		{
			"type": "text",
			"version": 63,
			"x": 60,
			"y": 1043,
			"width": 249.59417724609375,
			"height": 249.375,
			"strokeColor": "#7ee787",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🔹 Phase 1: select_function_name()\n\nBuilds a prompt context:\n  \"You are a function selector.\"\n  \"User request: {prompt}\"\n  \"Available functions: fn_add_numbers, ...\"\n\nBuilds a TOKEN TRIE from function names:\n  root → [id_1042] → fn_add_numbers (terminal)\n       → [id_855]  → fn_greet (terminal)\n       → ... (5 branches total)\n\nGeneration loop (greedy constrained):\n  while node.children:\n    logits = model.get_logits_from_input_ids(...)\n    allowed = list(node.children.keys())\n    next_id = _select_max_logit(logits, allowed)\n    # Only valid function-name tokens can be chosen!\n\n🔑 The model PHYSICALLY CANNOT generate\n   an invalid function name.",
			"fontSize": 9.5,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "el20",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"elementType": "text",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "🔹 Phase 1: select_function_name()\n\nBuilds a prompt context:\n  \"You are a function selector.\"\n  \"User request: {prompt}\"\n  \"Available functions: fn_add_numbers, ...\"\n\nBuilds a TOKEN TRIE from function names:\n  root → [id_1042] → fn_add_numbers (terminal)\n       → [id_855]  → fn_greet (terminal)\n       → ... (5 branches total)\n\nGeneration loop (greedy constrained):\n  while node.children:\n    logits = model.get_logits_from_input_ids(...)\n    allowed = list(node.children.keys())\n    next_id = _select_max_logit(logits, allowed)\n    # Only valid function-name tokens can be chosen!\n\n🔑 The model PHYSICALLY CANNOT generate\n   an invalid function name.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"versionNonce": 16799701,
			"index": "aH",
			"isDeleted": false,
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"angle": 0,
			"seed": 20,
			"groupIds": [
				"h_4sIxdgfnDtDkbflsN17",
				"9M_1g84owGeoA6rjSgbWX",
				"Ai2pLFxyBGRZBH5SkovyE"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1781643656018,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"locked": false,
			"rawText": "🔹 Phase 1: select_function_name()\n\nBuilds a prompt context:\n  \"You are a function selector.\"\n  \"User request: {prompt}\"\n  \"Available functions: fn_add_numbers, ...\"\n\nBuilds a TOKEN TRIE from function names:\n  root → [id_1042] → fn_add_numbers (terminal)\n       → [id_855]  → fn_greet (terminal)\n       → ... (5 branches total)\n\nGeneration loop (greedy constrained):\n  while node.children:\n    logits = model.get_logits_from_input_ids(...)\n    allowed = list(node.children.keys())\n    next_id = _select_max_logit(logits, allowed)\n    # Only valid function-name tokens can be chosen!\n\n🔑 The model PHYSICALLY CANNOT generate\n   an invalid function name."
		},
