		{
			"type": "text",
			"version": 61,
			"x": 450,
			"y": 1043,
			"width": 303.47833251953125,
			"height": 237.5,
			"strokeColor": "#ffa657",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🔹 Phase 2: _generate_parameters()\n\nNO LLM call — pure deterministic regex!\n\n1. Extract all numbers:\n   re.findall(r\"-?\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\", prompt)\n\n2. Extract all quoted strings:\n   re.findall(r\"['\"]([^'\"]+)['\"]\", prompt)\n\n3. For each parameter by type:\n   number/integer → positional from numbers list\n   boolean        → check for \"true\" / \"false\"\n   string         → _extract_string_param():\n       • name keyword + greeting desc → greet <Name>\n       • source/regex/replacement     → position-specific\n       • fallback                     → quoted strings / tokens\n\n✨ This is why the project is fast —\n   only 1 LLM forward pass per prompt!",
			"fontSize": 9.5,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "el22",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"elementType": "text",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "🔹 Phase 2: _generate_parameters()\n\nNO LLM call — pure deterministic regex!\n\n1. Extract all numbers:\n   re.findall(r\"-?\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\", prompt)\n\n2. Extract all quoted strings:\n   re.findall(r\"['\"]([^'\"]+)['\"]\", prompt)\n\n3. For each parameter by type:\n   number/integer → positional from numbers list\n   boolean        → check for \"true\" / \"false\"\n   string         → _extract_string_param():\n       • name keyword + greeting desc → greet <Name>\n       • source/regex/replacement     → position-specific\n       • fallback                     → quoted strings / tokens\n\n✨ This is why the project is fast —\n   only 1 LLM forward pass per prompt!",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
