			"text": "decode(*, model, prompt, functions) → DecodedCall\n  1. name = select_function_name(...)        ← LLM + trie\n  2. function_def = find by name             ← lookup\n  3. params = _generate_parameters(...)      ← regex\n  4. return {\"name\": name, \"parameters\": params}",
